sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI Pipeline
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant TrainOp as Training Operator<br/>(KFTO v1 / Trainer v2)
    participant Launcher as Launcher Pod<br/>(MPI master)
    participant Worker1 as Worker Pod 1<br/>(Training Image)
    participant Worker2 as Worker Pod N<br/>(Training Image)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,HFHub: Flow 1: Distributed Training (PyTorchJob / TrainJob)
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply PyTorchJob/TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>TrainOp: CRD Watch event<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    TrainOp->>Worker1: Schedule training pod<br/>Image: runtime/universal training
    TrainOp->>Worker2: Schedule training pod<br/>Image: runtime/universal training
    Worker1->>Worker2: NCCL/RCCL AllReduce<br/>Dynamic port, No encryption
    Worker1->>S3: Upload checkpoints<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
    Worker2->>S3: Upload checkpoints<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM

    Note over User,HFHub: Flow 2: MPI Distributed Training (OpenMPI Images)
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply TrainJob CR (MPI)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>TrainOp: CRD Watch event
    TrainOp->>Launcher: Schedule launcher pod<br/>Port: 2222/TCP SSH
    TrainOp->>Worker1: Schedule worker pod<br/>Port: 2222/TCP SSH
    TrainOp->>Worker2: Schedule worker pod<br/>Port: 2222/TCP SSH
    Launcher->>Worker1: SSH connection<br/>2222/TCP, SSH key auth
    Launcher->>Worker2: SSH connection<br/>2222/TCP, SSH key auth
    Launcher->>Worker1: mpirun → orted<br/>Dynamic port, SSH tunnel
    Worker1->>Worker2: NCCL/RCCL over InfiniBand/RDMA<br/>No encryption
    Worker1->>S3: Upload results<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+

    Note over User,HFHub: Flow 3: Universal Image Workbench Mode
    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Jupyter as Notebook Pod<br/>JupyterLab 8888/TCP

    Browser->>Route: Access workbench<br/>HTTPS/443, OAuth/OIDC
    Route->>Jupyter: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8888, Platform auth
    Jupyter->>K8sAPI: Submit TrainJob (SDK)<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
    Jupyter->>S3: Upload/download data<br/>HTTPS/443, AWS IAM
    Jupyter->>HFHub: Download models<br/>HTTPS/443, HF_TOKEN Bearer
